<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tool_ngrok">ToolNgrok</link></para>

<para>This class represents the Ngrok tool module in the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It extends the <link linkend="_class_module">Module</link> class and provides functionalities specific to Ngrok, such as loading configurations, setting versions, and retrieving executable paths. </para>
<para>
